WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.687
What if I was to tell you

00:00:02.589 --> 00:00:07.203
that a game of peekaboo&nbsp;
could change the world?

00:00:07.203 --> 00:00:08.440
Thanks to scientists,

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.562
we now know just how important

00:00:10.562 --> 00:00:13.285
the first five&nbsp;years are for 
our health and development,

00:00:13.285 --> 00:00:14.808
especially our brains.

00:00:14.808 --> 00:00:18.937
Our healthy development&nbsp;
depends on these top five things,

00:00:18.937 --> 00:00:20.542
One, connecting;

00:00:20.542 --> 00:00:22.212
two, talking;

00:00:22.212 --> 00:00:23.797
three, playing;

00:00:23.797 --> 00:00:25.472
four, a healthy&nbsp;home,

00:00:25.472 --> 00:00:27.049
five; community.

00:00:27.049 --> 00:00:30.836
All of this helps our brains 
and us reach our full potential.

00:00:30.836 --> 00:00:32.830
So what’s something you can do

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:35.192
that can really make a difference?

00:00:35.192 --> 00:00:37.746
Scientists call it&nbsp;serve and return.

00:00:37.746 --> 00:00:39.778
That’s just a grown-up way of saying

00:00:39.778 --> 00:00:41.926
each time you talk to us,

00:00:41.926 --> 00:00:43.077
play&nbsp;with us,

00:00:43.077 --> 00:00:44.233
make us laugh,

00:00:44.233 --> 00:00:47.792
it not only builds and 
strengthens our relationships

00:00:47.792 --> 00:00:49.206
and mental&nbsp;health,

00:00:49.760 --> 00:00:53.799
it actually teaches us some of 
the most important life skills.

00:00:53.799 --> 00:00:56.098
Imagine the difference&nbsp;we could make

00:00:56.098 --> 00:00:59.434
if everyone everywhere did this.

